<title>HONG KONG: Shinhan Investment to set US$50 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Shinhan Investment to set US$50 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger Sumitomo Finance (Asia) Ltd on Friday.</p>
<p>It will be formally launched on November 18.</p>
<p> BORROWER SHINHAN INVESTMENT BANK	    GUARANTOR   --</p>
<p> AMT	US$50 MLN   COUPON    6ML+45     MATURITY    364 DAYS</p>
<p> TYPE     FRCD	  ISS PRICE PAR	  LAUNCHED    18.NOV.96</p>
<p> PUTS     NONE	  CALLS     NONE	 REPLIES     --</p>
<p> LISTING  NONE	  REPAYMENT BULLET     DENOMS	US$500K</p>
<p> RATINGS  --	    SALE LMTS --</p>
<p> NEG PLG  --	    CRS DEF   --	   FORCE MAJ   --</p>
<p> GOV LAW  --	    HOME CTRY S.KOREA    TAX PROV    --</p>
<p> PAY DATE DEC 1996    NOTES     --</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES  CO-LEADS  US$4-5 MLN 8 BP ALL-IN 53</p>
<p>			    CO-MGRS   US$2-3 MLN 5 BP ALL-IN 50</p>
<p>ARRANGER  ING BARINGS, SUMITOMO FINANCE (ASIA) (BOOKS),</p>
<p>	     KDB BANK (UK) LTD</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
</text>
